                    "text": "You'd find a better job, but you'd rather have one really shitty job than three shitty jobs. Also, sometimes you strike gold and get a decent haul that you can ride for a month. It's like gambling with trash. ",
                    "choices": [
                        "0_start_5"
                    ]
                },
                {
